# 统一换行符，避免 Windows 上 CRLF 混进仓库导致 CI 上的格式检查无故失败。
#
# 注意：工作区检出时仍是 CRLF（Windows 编辑器友好），仓库内一律 LF。
* text=auto eol=lf

# ---- 二进制：不做任何换行转换 ----
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.gif binary
*.zip binary
*.tar binary
*.xz binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.lib binary
*.a binary

# ---- Windows 专用脚本保留 CRLF ----
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# ---- 明确按文本处理 ----
*.md text
*.txt text
*.yml text
*.yaml text
*.json text
*.py text
*.cmake text
CMakeLists.txt text
*.c text
*.h text
*.cpp text
*.hpp text
